      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, we've got a massive problem. That memo about the candidate voting against the community center funding just leaked. Reporters are already calling. If this gets out that they blocked the funding, our polling is going to tank. How do we handle the press on this? We need a response that doesn't make them look like they're anti-community.",
